@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ito-il27-nouns`
IMPORT `ito-il27-tax-years`
IMPORT `ito-s40c-academic-degree`
IMPORT `ito-s40d-professional-studies`
IMPORT `ito-s40e-no-double-credit`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Tests for ss 40D, 40E and 40F. Row IL-27. Expected values worked by hand from lines 1674-1688 before the rules were run; none edited.
-- First text (studies ended 2023 or later): one point in min(years, 3) tax years from the tax year after the studies ended.
-- Second text (ended 2018-2022): one point in the year after, or the one after that, by election. At least 1,700 hours.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Tests — sections 40D, 40E and 40F`

-- The fields: tax year; resident; hours; entitled to a recognised certificate; years of study; tax year the studies ended; proof given;
-- election (TRUE: the second tax year after); foreign worker.
GIVEN `the year`  IS A NUMBER
      `hours`     IS A NUMBER
      `years`     IS A NUMBER
      `ended`     IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An individual's vocational studies, for section 40D`
`in` `the year` `, vocational studies of` `hours` `hours and` `years` `years, ended in` `ended` MEANS
    `An individual's vocational studies, for section 40D` OF `the year`, TRUE, `hours`, TRUE, `years`, `ended`, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE

GIVEN `the year`  IS A NUMBER
      `ended`     IS A NUMBER
      `later`     IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An individual's vocational studies, for section 40D`
`in` `the year` `, vocational studies of 1,700 hours ended in` `ended` `, electing the second tax year after:` `later` MEANS
    `An individual's vocational studies, for section 40D`  OF `the year`, TRUE, 1700, TRUE, 2, `ended`, TRUE, `later`, FALSE

GIVEN `resident` IS A BOOLEAN
      `entitled` IS A BOOLEAN
      `proof`    IS A BOOLEAN
      `foreign`  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An individual's vocational studies, for section 40D`
`in 2025, studies of 1,700 hours ended in 2023; resident:` `resident` `, entitled:` `entitled` `, proof given:` `proof` `, foreign worker:` `foreign` MEANS
    `An individual's vocational studies, for section 40D` OF 2025, `resident`, 1700, `entitled`, 3, 2023, `proof`, FALSE, `foreign`

§§ `Section 40D — the first text`

-- 1,700 hours, 3 years, ended 2023: a point in 2024, 2025, 2026; none in 2027.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in` 2024 `, vocational studies of` 1700 `hours and` 3 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in` 2026 `, vocational studies of` 1700 `hours and` 3 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in` 2027 `, vocational studies of` 1700 `hours and` 3 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 0
-- 4 years of study: still three tax years. 1 year: one.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in` 2026 `, vocational studies of` 1700 `hours and` 4 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in` 2027 `, vocational studies of` 1700 `hours and` 4 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in` 2024 `, vocational studies of` 1700 `hours and` 1 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in` 2025 `, vocational studies of` 1700 `hours and` 1 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 0
-- Both sides of the 1,700 hours: 1,699 gives nothing, 1,700 gives the point.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in` 2024 `, vocational studies of` 1699 `hours and` 3 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in` 2024 `, vocational studies of` 1700 `hours and` 3 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 1
-- The studies ended in the tax year asked about: the point starts the year after.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in` 2024 `, vocational studies of` 1700 `hours and` 3 `years, ended in` 2024) EQUALS 0

§§ `Section 40D — the second text (studies that ended 2018 to 2022)`

-- Ended 2022: "the tax year after" is 2023, "the second after" is 2024. One tax year only.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in` 2024 `, vocational studies of 1,700 hours ended in` 2022 `, electing the second tax year after:` FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in` 2024 `, vocational studies of 1,700 hours ended in` 2022 `, electing the second tax year after:` TRUE) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in` 2025 `, vocational studies of 1,700 hours ended in` 2022 `, electing the second tax year after:` TRUE) EQUALS 0
-- Ended 2018 (the first year of the second text): a point in 2019 or 2020; none in 2024.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in` 2024 `, vocational studies of 1,700 hours ended in` 2018 `, electing the second tax year after:` TRUE) EQUALS 0
-- Ended 2017: the text then in force is not in the source bundle.
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in` 2024 `, vocational studies of 1,700 hours ended in` 2017 `, electing the second tax year after:` TRUE) BECAUSE "row IL-27 does not hold the text of section 40D for studies that ended before 2018"
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in` 2023 `, vocational studies of 1,700 hours ended in` 2022 `, electing the second tax year after:` TRUE) BECAUSE "row IL-27 does not hold the text of these sections for a tax year before 2024"

§§ `Section 40D — the conditions`

#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in 2025, studies of 1,700 hours ended in 2023; resident:` TRUE `, entitled:` TRUE `, proof given:` TRUE `, foreign worker:` FALSE) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in 2025, studies of 1,700 hours ended in 2023; resident:` FALSE `, entitled:` TRUE `, proof given:` TRUE `, foreign worker:` FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in 2025, studies of 1,700 hours ended in 2023; resident:` TRUE `, entitled:` FALSE `, proof given:` TRUE `, foreign worker:` FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in 2025, studies of 1,700 hours ended in 2023; resident:` TRUE `, entitled:` TRUE `, proof given:` FALSE `, foreign worker:` FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 40D for` (`in 2025, studies of 1,700 hours ended in 2023; resident:` TRUE `, entitled:` TRUE `, proof given:` TRUE `, foreign worker:` TRUE) BECAUSE "section 48A and the regulations made under it are not encoded in this model"

§§ `Section 40E — the election; section 40F repealed`

-- A first-degree-less case: a second degree (half a point) and vocational studies (one point), both ended 2023, tax year 2024.
-- Elects 40C: 1/2. Elects 40D: 1. Nothing elected: refused. Meets only one: that one. Meets neither: 0.
#ASSERT `the credit points under sections 40C, 40D and 40E for` (LIST (`An individual's academic studies, for section 40C` OF 2024, TRUE, `a second academic degree`, TRUE, 2, 2023, 0, 0, TRUE, NOTHING, FALSE, `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, FALSE)) `and` (`in` 2024 `, vocational studies of` 1700 `hours and` 3 `years, ended in` 2023) `, the choice being` (JUST `the points of section 40C`) EQUALS 1/2
#ASSERT `the credit points under sections 40C, 40D and 40E for` (LIST (`An individual's academic studies, for section 40C` OF 2024, TRUE, `a second academic degree`, TRUE, 2, 2023, 0, 0, TRUE, NOTHING, FALSE, `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, FALSE)) `and` (`in` 2024 `, vocational studies of` 1700 `hours and` 3 `years, ended in` 2023) `, the choice being` (JUST `the point of section 40D`) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under sections 40C, 40D and 40E for` (LIST (`An individual's academic studies, for section 40C` OF 2024, TRUE, `a second academic degree`, TRUE, 2, 2023, 0, 0, TRUE, NOTHING, FALSE, `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, FALSE)) `and` (`in` 2024 `, vocational studies of` 1700 `hours and` 3 `years, ended in` 2023) `, the choice being` NOTHING BECAUSE "section 40E gives one who meets both section 40C and section 40D a choice, and he has not made it"
-- Vocational studies with only 1,699 hours: the conditions of 40D are not met, so he has the degree's half point with no election.
#ASSERT `the credit points under sections 40C, 40D and 40E for` (LIST (`An individual's academic studies, for section 40C` OF 2024, TRUE, `a second academic degree`, TRUE, 2, 2023, 0, 0, TRUE, NOTHING, FALSE, `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, FALSE)) `and` (`in` 2024 `, vocational studies of` 1699 `hours and` 3 `years, ended in` 2023) `, the choice being` NOTHING EQUALS 1/2
-- No degree (no studies), vocational studies met: the point of 40D.
#ASSERT `the credit points under sections 40C, 40D and 40E for` (LIST ) `and` (`in` 2024 `, vocational studies of` 1700 `hours and` 3 `years, ended in` 2023) `, the choice being` NOTHING EQUALS 1
-- Neither met: nothing.
#ASSERT `the credit points under sections 40C, 40D and 40E for` (LIST ) `and` (`in` 2024 `, vocational studies of` 1699 `hours and` 3 `years, ended in` 2023) `, the choice being` NOTHING EQUALS 0
-- The year the points have run out: she meets both conditions, elects 40C, and in 2026 the half point of 2023 studies is over (0).
#ASSERT `the credit points under sections 40C, 40D and 40E for` (LIST (`An individual's academic studies, for section 40C` OF 2026, TRUE, `a second academic degree`, TRUE, 2, 2023, 0, 0, TRUE, NOTHING, FALSE, `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, FALSE)) `and` (`in` 2026 `, vocational studies of` 1700 `hours and` 3 `years, ended in` 2023) `, the choice being` (JUST `the points of section 40C`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under sections 40C, 40D and 40E for` (LIST ) `and` (`in` 2023 `, vocational studies of` 1700 `hours and` 3 `years, ended in` 2022) `, the choice being` NOTHING BECAUSE "row IL-27 does not hold the text of these sections for a tax year before 2024"

§§ `v0.1.1 — 40E: no election needed where both give the same`

-- A first degree (3 years, ended 2023) gives 1 in 2024 and vocational studies give 1: either election gives 1, so no choice is needed. In 2027 both give 0.
#ASSERT `the credit points under sections 40C, 40D and 40E for` (LIST (`An individual's academic studies, for section 40C` OF 2024, TRUE, `a first academic degree`, TRUE, 3, 2023, 0, 0, TRUE, NOTHING, FALSE, `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, FALSE)) `and` (`in` 2024 `, vocational studies of` 1700 `hours and` 3 `years, ended in` 2023) `, the choice being` NOTHING EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under sections 40C, 40D and 40E for` (LIST (`An individual's academic studies, for section 40C` OF 2027, TRUE, `a first academic degree`, TRUE, 3, 2023, 0, 0, TRUE, NOTHING, FALSE, `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, FALSE)) `and` (`in` 2027 `, vocational studies of` 1700 `hours and` 3 `years, ended in` 2023) `, the choice being` NOTHING EQUALS 0
